{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07777","headline":"送元公之鄂渚寻观主张骖鸾 · 孟浩然","name":"送元公之鄂渚寻观主张骖鸾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃花春水涨，之子忽乘流。\n岘首辞蛟浦，江中问鹤楼。\n赠君青竹杖，送尔白苹洲。\n应是神仙子，相期汗漫游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}